sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>Python / Notebook
    participant Model as trustyai.Model<br/>Python Wrapper
    participant JPype as JPype1<br/>JVM Bridge
    participant Java as TrustyAI Java<br/>Explainability Engine
    participant Arrow as Apache Arrow<br/>IPC Transfer
    participant Viz as Visualizations<br/>Matplotlib / Bokeh

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
        Note over User,Viz: Flow 1: Local Model Explainability (In-Process)
        User->>Model: wrap(sklearn_model, dataframe)
        Model->>JPype: Initialize JVM (lazy, on first use)
        JPype->>Java: Start JVM with explainability-arrow JAR

        User->>Model: LIME/SHAP explain(inputs)
        Model->>Arrow: Serialize DataFrame → Arrow IPC bytes
        Arrow->>Java: Zero-copy data transfer
        Java->>Model: Callback: predict(perturbations)
        Model->>User: Run user model predict()
        User-->>Model: Predictions
        Model->>Arrow: Serialize predictions → Arrow IPC
        Arrow->>Java: Batch predictions
        Note over Java: Runs LIME/SHAP algorithm<br/>(thousands of perturbations)
        Java-->>Arrow: Explanation results
        Arrow-->>Model: Saliency maps / feature importances
        Model-->>User: LimeResults / SHAPResults
        User->>Viz: plot(results)
        Viz-->>User: Saliency chart / dashboard
    end

    participant API as TrustyAIMetricsService<br/>API Client
    participant Route as OpenShift API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Service as TrustyAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over User,Thanos: Flow 2: Remote Metrics (Optional, via [api] extra)
        User->>API: TrustyAIMetricsService(token, namespace)
        API->>Route: GET Routes<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / in-cluster
        Route-->>API: TrustyAI Service URL, Thanos URL

        User->>API: upload_data(dataframe)
        API->>Service: POST /data/upload<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS
        Service-->>API: 200 OK

        User->>API: get_model_info()
        API->>Service: GET /info<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS
        Service-->>API: Model metadata

        User->>API: schedule_metric(SPD, ...)
        API->>Service: POST /metrics/spd<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS
        Service-->>API: Metric scheduled

        User->>API: query_metric(SPD)
        API->>Thanos: GET /api/v1/query<br/>PromQL query<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS
        Thanos-->>API: Time-series data
        API-->>User: Metric results
    end
